{:adr-id "2607152200"
 :title "cloud-itonami-isic-0121 (growing of grapes) vineyard-operations-coordination actor"
 :status :accepted
 :date "2026-07-14"
 :deciders ["Jun Kawasaki (agent-executed, standing authorization)"]
 :related ["ADR-2607122200" "ADR-2607011000" "ADR-2607152100"]

 :context
 "Smaller-batch redo (6 agents, more capable model, mandatory verification) after
  a prior 18-agent haiku batch had a 61% defect rate. Built from
  cloud-itonami-isic-0141 (raising of cattle and buffaloes) as the module-structure
  template, with clojure -M:test independently re-run from fresh clones before and
  after push."

 :scope-exclusions
 ["direct field-equipment operation (grower's exclusive authority)"
  "finalizing a spray-application decision (agronomist/grower authority)"
  "harvest-timing / replanting economic decisions (remain human authority)"]

 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-0121 with Governor, Facts, Registry, Store, Advisor,
  Phase, Operation, Sim (mirrors cloud-itonami-isic-0141 module-for-module,
  namespace vineyardops.*):
  - Governor (VineyardOperationsGovernor): 5 hard checks (vineyard-not-registered,
    no-execution, field-equipment-or-spray-blocked, op-not-allowed,
    vineyard-count-invalid) + 3 escalation gates (always-escalate crop-health
    concern, cost-threshold supply orders, low confidence < 0.7)
  - Facts: supply categories with cost thresholds (rootstock/fertilizer/equipment),
    grape classes (wine-grape/table-grape)
  - Registry: independent pure predicates (cost-exceeds-threshold?,
    vineyard-count-non-positive?, confidence-below-floor?)
  - Store: Store protocol + MemStore (registered-vineyard lookup)
  - Advisor: Advisor protocol + MockAdvisor (4 ops)
  - Phase: 0->3 rollout gate
  - Operation: composes advisor -> governor -> phase-gate (langgraph-clj wiring
    deferred, matching 0141's own stub)
  - Sim: demo runner with a working -main
  - Operations: log-vineyard-record, schedule-field-operation,
    flag-crop-health-concern, order-supplies (closed allowlist, :effect :propose)
  - Tests: 30 tests / 90 assertions (facts, governor, phase, registry, store), all green
  - All .cljc (portable, no JVM interop), AGPL-3.0-or-later
  - README/business-model/operator-guide describe the real API"

 :consequences
 {:positive
  ["Grape-growing (0121) now genuinely implemented and fully tested"
   "Scope boundaries (field-equipment operation, spray-application finalization)
    hardcoded in governor checks, not just asserted in prose"
   "Crop-health escalation (flag-crop-health-concern always human) is a core
    design invariant"
   "Portable .cljc, zero JVM-only constructs, clj-kondo 0 errors / 0 warnings"]
  :negative
  ["Real persistent store (Datomic/kotoba-server) is a follow-up (in-memory for now)"
   "langgraph-clj StateGraph wiring (real interrupt-before/checkpoint resume) is
    deferred scaffolding, matching 0141's own stub status"]}

